NegroniMetal change to ios-flame 745c434 phone/metal2 (on top of flame/0001-0006), applied by scripts/metal/fetch-sources.sh:
the m2v device policy from env NEGRONIMETAL_POLICY in both bridges (nmb_device_open and the self-test open), through
objects::negroni_policy(). Values: exact (m2v defaults), compositor (default: device 8-bit unorm linear filter and
8-bit unorm color writes, containment on), compositor-srgb (compositor + device sRGB encode), unsafe (compositor +
containment UnsafeOff + isolation Off). Needs m2v/0003 (ColorWritesPolicy, the Turnip filter row).

